      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\n<div class=\"august-issue-banner\">\n    <div class=\"august-banner-badge\">🔔 14 Official Languages Edition</div>\n    <div class=\"august-banner-content\">\n        <h4>Vol. 2026 — Master Editorial Hub</h4>\n        <p>Welcome to the central editorial hub for beginner language learners (CEFR A0–A1). Frequency research demonstrates that these 10 core verbs account for up to 80% of daily spoken output across all 14 of our official languages!</p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2rem 0; padding: 1.5rem; background: #faf7f2; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--ink-light, #e2e8f0);\">\n    <h3 style=\"margin-top:0; color:var(--post-palette-accent, #d97706);\">🌐 14 Official Languages Navigation Hub</h3>\n    <p style=\"color:var(--ink-secondary); margin-bottom:1.25rem;\">Select any target language below to explore its deep-dive A0–A1 guide, including conjugation highlights, collocations, false-friend traps, and high-frequency idioms:</p>\n    \n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 0.75rem;\">\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-en.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🇬🇧 English Guide ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-fr.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🇫🇷 French Guide ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-it.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🇮🇹 Italian Guide ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-ru.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🇷🇺 Russian Guide ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-el.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🇬🇷 Greek Guide ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-tt.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🌐 Tatar Guide ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-ba.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🌐 Bashkir Guide ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-br.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🌐 Breton Guide ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-pt.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🇵🇹 Portuguese Guide ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-es.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🇪🇸 Spanish Guide ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-de.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🇩🇪 German Guide ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-hy.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🇦🇲 Armenian Guide ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-ka.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🇬🇪 Georgian Guide ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-cv.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🌐 Chuvash Guide ↗</a>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"verb-map-container\">\n    <h3 class=\"verb-map-title\">🗺️ The 10 Essential Core Verbs (CEFR A0–A1 Focus)</h3>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:1rem; color:var(--ink-secondary);\">These 10 essential action anchors power everyday speech across all 14 official languages. Mastery of these verbs unlocks simple survival communication, basic questions, personal identity, and daily needs.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"verb-map-grid\">\n        <div class=\"verb-node-card\"><strong>1. To Be</strong> — Existence, location, identity, states.</div>\n        <div class=\"verb-node-card\"><strong>2. To Have</strong> — Possession, bodily states, obligations.</div>\n        <div class=\"verb-node-card\"><strong>3. To Do / Make</strong> — Actions, activities, creating things.</div>\n        <div class=\"verb-node-card\"><strong>4. To Go</strong> — Movement, direction, travel plans.</div>\n        <div class=\"verb-node-card\"><strong>5. To Come</strong> — Origins, arrivals, invitations.</div>\n        <div class=\"verb-node-card\"><strong>6. To Say / Tell</strong> — Speech, sharing information, asking questions.</div>\n        <div class=\"verb-node-card\"><strong>7. To See / Look</strong> — Visual perception, understanding.</div>\n        <div class=\"verb-node-card\"><strong>8. To Know</strong> — Facts, skills, familiarity with people/places.</div>\n        <div class=\"verb-node-card\"><strong>9. To Want</strong> — Needs, wishes, ordering food & drinks.</div>\n        <div class=\"verb-node-card\"><strong>10. To Like / Give</strong> — Preferences, appreciation, exchange.</div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2.5rem 0;\">\n    <h3 class=\"editorial-heading\">🔍 14-Language Core Comparative Matrix</h3>\n    <p style=\"color:var(--ink-secondary); margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\">Below is the complete direct comparative matrix showing how each core concept translates across all 14 official COSY languages. Notice how closely language families share grammatical structures and root patterns!</p>\n\n    <div style=\"overflow-x: auto;\">\n        <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.9rem; text-align: left;\">\n            <thead>\n                <tr style=\"background-color: var(--post-palette-accent, #d97706); color: #ffffff;\">\n                    <th style=\"padding: 10px;\">Concept</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 10px;\">🇬🇧 EN</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 10px;\">🇫🇷 FR</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 10px;\">🇮🇹 IT</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 10px;\">🇪🇸 ES</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 10px;\">🇵🇹 PT</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 10px;\">🇩🇪 DE</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 10px;\">🇷🇺 RU</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 10px;\">🇬🇷 EL</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 10px;\">🌐 BR</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 10px;\">🇦🇲 HY</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 10px;\">🌐 TT</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 10px;\">🌐 BA</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 10px;\">🌐 CV</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 10px;\">🇬🇪 KA</th>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n                <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1;\">\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px; font-weight: bold;\">1. Be</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">be</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">être</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">essere</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">ser / estar</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">ser / estar</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">sein</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">быть</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">είμαι</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">bezañ</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">լինել</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">булу</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">булыу</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">пулма</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">ყოფნა</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1; background: #f8fafc;\">\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px; font-weight: bold;\">2. Have</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">have</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">avoir</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">avere</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">tener</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">ter</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">haben</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">иметь / у меня есть</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">έχω</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">kaout</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">ունենալ</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">ия булу / бар</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">эйә булыу / бар</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">пулма / пур</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">ქონა / ყოლა</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1;\">\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px; font-weight: bold;\">3. Do / Make</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">do / make</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">faire</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">fare</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">hacer</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">fazer</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">machen / tun</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">делать</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">κάνω</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">ober</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">անել</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">эшләү</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">эшләү</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">тăвас</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">კეთება</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1; background: #f8fafc;\">\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px; font-weight: bold;\">4. Go</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">go</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">aller</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">andare</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">ir</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">ir</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">gehen</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">идти / ехать</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">πηγαίνω</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">mont</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">գնալ</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">бару</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">барыу</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">кайрма</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">წასვლα</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1;\">\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px; font-weight: bold;\">5. Come</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">come</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">venir</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">venire</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">venir</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">vir</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">kommen</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">приходить</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">έρχομαι</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">dont</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">γալ</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">килү</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">килеү</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">килме</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">მოსვლა</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1; background: #f8fafc;\">\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px; font-weight: bold;\">6. Say / Tell</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">say / tell</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">dire</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">dire</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">decir</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">dizer</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">sagen</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">говорить / сказать</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">λέω</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">lavar</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">ասել</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">әйтү</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">әйтеү</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">калама</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">თქმა</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1;\">\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px; font-weight: bold;\">7. See / Look</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">see</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">voir</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">vedere</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">ver</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">ver</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">sehen</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">видеть</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">βλέπω</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">gwelout</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">տեսնել</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">креү</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">күреү</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">курма</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">ნახვა</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1; background: #f8fafc;\">\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px; font-weight: bold;\">8. Know</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">know</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">savoir / connaître</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">sapere / conoscere</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">saber / conocer</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">saber / conhecer</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">wissen / kennen</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">знать</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">ξέρω</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">gouzout</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">իմանալ</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">белү</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">белеү</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">пĕлме</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">ცოდნა</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1;\">\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px; font-weight: bold;\">9. Want</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">want</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">vouloir</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">volere</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">querer</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">querer</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">wollen</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">хотеть</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">θέλω</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">c'hoant kaout</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">ուզել</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">теләү</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">теләү</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">былмаш</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">ნდომა</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1; background: #f8fafc;\">\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px; font-weight: bold;\">10. Like / Give</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">like / give</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">aimer / donner</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">piacere / dare</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">gustar / dar</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">gostar / dar</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">mögen / geben</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">нравиться / давать</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">μου αρέσει / δίνω</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">plijout / reiñ</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">հավանել / տալ</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">ошату / бирү</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">ошатыу / биреү</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">килĕшме / парас</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">მოწონება / მიცემა</td>\n                </tr>\n            </tbody>\n        </table>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2.5rem 0; padding: 1.5rem; background: #f1f5f9; border-radius: 12px;\">\n    <h3 class=\"editorial-heading\" style=\"margin-top:0;\">🧬 Language Family Nuances & Cross-Family Insights</h3>\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">\n        <div style=\"background:#ffffff; padding:1.25rem; border-radius:8px; border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6;\">\n            <h4 style=\"margin-top:0; color:#1e3a8a;\">🌳 Indo-European Family</h4>\n            <p style=\"font-size:0.9rem; color:#334155;\"><strong>Sub-groups:</strong> Romance (FR, IT, ES, PT), Germanic (EN, DE), Slavic (RU), Hellenic (EL), Celtic (BR), Armenian (HY).</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:0.9rem; color:#334155;\">Romance languages rely heavily on auxiliary verbs (be/have) for compound tenses and feature explicit subject-verb endings. Germanic languages split modal and action verbs clearly, while Slavic and Armenian utilize aspectual pairs (imperfective vs. perfective).</p>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background:#ffffff; padding:1.25rem; border-radius:8px; border-left: 4px solid #10b981;\">\n            <h4 style=\"margin-top:0; color:#065f46;\">🏹 Turkic Family</h4>\n            <p style=\"font-size:0.9rem; color:#334155;\"><strong>Languages:</strong> Tatar (TT), Bashkir (BA), Chuvash (CV).</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:0.9rem; color:#334155;\">Turkic languages are agglutinative: verb stems stay intact while tense, person, and negation are attached via ordered suffixes at the end of the word. Possession uses existential predicates (<em>bar</em> / <em>pur</em> = \"there is\") rather than a standalone \"to have\" verb.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background:#ffffff; padding:1.25rem; border-radius:8px; border-left: 4px solid #8b5cf6;\">\n            <h4 style=\"margin-top:0; color:#4c1d95;\">🏔️ Kartvelian Family</h4>\n            <p style=\"font-size:0.9rem; color:#334155;\"><strong>Language:</strong> Georgian (KA).</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:0.9rem; color:#334155;\">Georgian features polypersonal agreement (the verb marks both the subject and the object simultaneously). Possessive and emotional verbs use indirect inversion: \"I have a car\" is expressed literally as \"To me exists a car\".</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2.5rem 0;\">\n    <h3 class=\"editorial-heading\">🔗 COSY Ecosystem Practice Integrations</h3>\n    <p style=\"color:var(--ink-secondary); margin-bottom: 1rem;\">Put these 10 core verbs into active memory with automated drills and interactive verb tables:</p>\n    \n    <div style=\"display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:1rem;\">\n        <a href=\"https://cosylanguages.github.io/COSYpractice/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"padding: 0.85rem 1.5rem; background: var(--post-palette-accent, #d97706); color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none;\">🎯 Practice Drills on COSYpractice ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"https://cosylanguages.github.io/COSYtools/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"padding: 0.85rem 1.5rem; background: #0d9488; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none;\">🛠 Verb Tables on COSYtools ↗</a>\n    </div>\n</section>\n"
    }
